================================================================================
Third-party material
================================================================================

The screenshots and screen-recording videos in `docs/assets/` depict the user
interface of the Electronic Lab Notebook (ELN) and of the OpenChemLib chemical
structure editor. Those interfaces, their trademarks, and their branding remain
the property of their respective owners and are reproduced here for the purpose
of documenting how to use the software. The CC BY 4.0 grant above covers this
project's own text, layout, and capture of those screens — it does not and
cannot relicense the depicted software.

External databases referenced in the documentation (PubChem, GESTIS, CAS
SciFinder) are subject to their own terms of use.
